Folder Contents

This folder contains datasets and analysis files used to build models linking protein circuit topology with folding free energy and folding/unfolding kinetics.

ACPro Dataset

ACPRO_22avg.csv
Input data from the ACPro database.

ACPRO_PSC_VA_v1.csv
Topological data derived from ACPro protein structures.

KPro Dataset

KPro.csv
Input data from the KPro database.

KPro_PSC_VA_v1.csv
Topological data derived from KPro protein structures.

KPro_VA_v2.csv
Pre-processed data from the KPro database.

ProThermDB Dataset

ProThermDB.csv
Input data from the ProThermDB database.

ProThermDB_PSC_VA_v1.csv
Topological data derived from ProThermDB protein structures.

ProThermDB_VA_v1.csv
Pre-processed data from the ProThermDB database.

Structural Data

Pre_processed_PDBs.zip
Archive containing pre-processed PDB structures used for analysis.

Analysis

CT_energy_predict.ipynb
Jupyter notebook containing data analysis and model development.
